## Repository workflow

- Read this file before editing code.
- Prefer existing architecture, naming, package manager, formatter, linter, and test commands.
- Make the smallest coherent patch. Avoid unrelated rewrites, drive-by formatting, or dependency changes.
- Add or update tests for externally visible behavior changes and bug fixes.
- Summarize validation commands and results in the final response.

